    "cadence-intro": [
      {
        "lines": [
          "Pier stage is open. No flows, no turns. Just you, your lead, and the beat.",
          "Hit each note as it reaches the line. Clean hits drain my hype. Miss too many and the crowd boos you off.",
          "Drain my hype before the track ends and the pier is yours."
